/-!
# QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4Semisimple — Prop-level semisimplicity + trace nondegeneracy of H₄(q)

**T2-b capstone** (beans `qou-308a` / `qou-5lbe`; route fixed by
[`docs/audits/2026-07-19-t2b-rank34-ascent-routes.md` §2]): the two honest
reachable rank-4 statements, both **det-free** — the 24×24 Gram determinant
is sympy-verified but Lean-out-of-reach (`det_fin_24` would carry 24! terms),
so nothing here touches it.

* **(i) `isSemisimpleRing_H4A`** — transfer of `IsSemisimpleRing` along the
  explicit rank-4 Wedderburn isomorphism `wedderburn₄` of
  `HeckeH4Wedderburn`, with the matrix factors supplied by
  `QOU.MathlibExt.MatrixSemisimple` — the rank-4 semisimplicity statement
  the cited `WenzlCriterion` / `SchurElementCriterion` classes carry, now
  *proved* rather than cited at this rank (mirrors `HeckeH3Semisimple`).
* **(ii) `exists_pairing_ne_zero₄`** — the trace-nondegeneracy half of the
  Wenzl hypothesis pair at the 3→4 rung: whenever the five per-block
  Markov weights are nonzero, every nonzero `y ∈ H₄(q)` pairs nontrivially
  with some `w` under the level-4 Markov trace `trM4`.  Proved from the
  block decomposition `trM4_eq_blocks` (the Wedderburn expansion
  $\mathrm{tr}_M = \sum_\lambda y_\lambda \chi_\lambda$) plus a
  block-projection witness — `w` is the `wedderburnInvV₄` preimage of the
  dual elementary matrix in a block where `y`'s image is nonzero.

The five Markov weights are sympy-solved from the 24-equation linear system
`TRM4 = Σ_λ y_λ · (block-trace rows of A)` (unique solution, verified
exactly), and `trM4_eq_blocks` re-verifies them **in Lean** by
`linear_combination` — nothing is trusted from the computation.  Their
numerators factor into the Jones degeneracy linear forms in `z` (see each
weight's docstring); the five nonvanishing hypotheses of (ii) are exactly
the rank-4 analogue of the factor-by-factor hypotheses of
`HeckeH3GramNondegeneracy.gramMatrix_det_ne_zero`.

HONESTY (STRICT, §"Axiomatization is NOT a Proof"): every lemma is
discharged by computation — no axiom, no `sorry`, no conditional class, no
`native_decide`.

Base ring (§7c): generic `[Field K]`; no archimedean construct.

-- Ref: [wenzl1988] https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01239526
-- Ref: [jones1987] https://doi.org/10.2307/1971403
-/

namespace QOU.Machinery.H4

variable {K : Type*} [Field K]

/-- **H₄(q) is a semisimple ring at every Wenzl-generic parameter
    (sorry-free):** transfer along the explicit rank-4 Wedderburn
    isomorphism, with the matrix factors supplied by
    `QOU.MathlibExt.MatrixSemisimple`. -/
theorem isSemisimpleRing_H4A (q : K) (hq : q ≠ 0) (h2 : q ^ 2 + 1 ≠ 0)
    (h3 : q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1 ≠ 0) (h4 : q ^ 4 + 1 ≠ 0) :
    IsSemisimpleRing (H4A K (q - q⁻¹)) :=
  ((wedderburn₄ q hq h2 h3 h4).symm.toRingEquiv).isSemisimpleRing

/-! ## The five per-block Markov weights

Sympy-solved (unique) from `TRM4 = Σ_λ y_λ·(block-trace rows)`, authored in
atom-separated form, re-verified in Lean by `trM4_eq_blocks`. -/

/-- Markov weight of the $(4)$ (trivial) character weight; numerator $(qz+1)((q^2+1)qz+1)((q^4+q^2+1)qz+1)$. -/
noncomputable def markovWeightPlus (q z : K) : K :=
  q ^ 9*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 8*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 + 2*q ^ 7*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + 3*q ^ 6*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 + 2*q ^ 5*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 5*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z + 4*q ^ 4*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 3*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + 2*q ^ 3*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z + 3*q ^ 2*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 + 3*q*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z + (q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹

/-- Markov weight of the $(1,1,1,1)$ (sign) character weight; numerator $-q^3(z-q)(q^2 z - (q^3 - z))((q^4+q^2)z - (q^5 - z))$. -/
noncomputable def markovWeightMinus (q z : K) : K :=
  q ^ 12*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹ - 3*q ^ 11*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z + 3*q ^ 10*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 - q ^ 9*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 - 2*q ^ 9*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z + 4*q ^ 8*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 - 2*q ^ 7*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 - q ^ 7*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z + 3*q ^ 6*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 - 2*q ^ 5*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 4*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 - q ^ 3*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3

/-- Markov weight of the $(2,2)$ block weight; numerator $-q^3(z-q)(qz+1)$ — the rank-3 degeneracy pair $(z-q)$, $(qz+1)$. -/
noncomputable def markovWeight22 (q z : K) : K :=
  q ^ 5*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*z - q ^ 4*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 4*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ - q ^ 3*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*z

/-- Markov weight of the $(3,1)$ block weight; numerator $-q(z-q)(qz+1)((q^2+1)qz+1)$. -/
noncomputable def markovWeight31 (q z : K) : K :=
  q ^ 6*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 - q ^ 5*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 5*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z - q ^ 3*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + 2*q ^ 3*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z - 2*q ^ 2*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 2*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹ - q*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z

/-- Markov weight of the $(2,1,1)$ block weight; numerator $q^2(z-q)(qz+1)(q^2 z - (q^3 - z))$. -/
noncomputable def markovWeight211 (q z : K) : K :=
  q ^ 7*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z - 2*q ^ 6*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 6*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹ + q ^ 5*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 - 2*q ^ 5*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z + q ^ 3*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 - q ^ 3*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z + q ^ 2*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2

set_option maxRecDepth 8000 in
set_option maxHeartbeats 64000000 in
/-- **The Wedderburn block decomposition of the level-4 Markov trace
    (sorry-free):** `trM4 = Σ_λ y_λ·χ_λ` with the five explicit weights —
    24 scalar identities rolled into one linear goal, closed by
    `linear_combination` against `mul_inv_cancel₀` with sympy-derived,
    exactly-verified cofactors. -/
theorem trM4_eq_blocks (q z : K) (hq : q ≠ 0) (h2 : q ^ 2 + 1 ≠ 0)
    (h3 : q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1 ≠ 0) (h4 : q ^ 4 + 1 ≠ 0) (v : Fin 24 → K) :
    trM4 z (q - q⁻¹) v =
      markovWeightPlus q z * chiNF₄ q v
        + markovWeightMinus q z * chiNF₄ (-q⁻¹) v
        + markovWeight22 q z * (blockOf22 q v).trace
        + markovWeight31 q z * (blockOf31 q v).trace
        + markovWeight211 q z * (blockOf211 q v).trace := by
  simp only [trM4, TRM4, markovWeightPlus, markovWeightMinus, markovWeight22,
    markovWeight31, markovWeight211, chiNF₄, blockOf22, blockOf31, blockOf211,
    Matrix.trace, Matrix.diag, Fin.sum_univ_two, Fin.sum_univ_three,
    sum_univ_24, Matrix.of_apply, Matrix.cons_val_zero, Matrix.cons_val',
    Matrix.cons_val, Fin.isValue]
  linear_combination (norm := ring1)
      (q ^ 17*v 23*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹ ^ 2*z ^ 3 + q ^ 16*v 21*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 3*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 16*v 23*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹ ^ 2*z ^ 2 + q ^ 16*v 23*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 15*v 20*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 3 - q ^ 15*v 21*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 3*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 15*v 21*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 3*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z + q ^ 15*v 21*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 3*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 15*v 21*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 15*v 22*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 3 + 2*q ^ 15*v 23*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹ ^ 2*z ^ 3 + q ^ 15*v 23*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 15*v 23*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 14*v 16*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 3*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 14*v 18*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 3*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 14*v 20*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 14*v 20*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 14*v 21*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 3*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 2 - q ^ 14*v 21*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 3*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 14*v 21*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 3*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z + q ^ 14*v 21*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 14*v 21*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + q ^ 14*v 22*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹*z ^ 2 + q ^ 14*v 22*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*z ^ 3 + 2*q ^ 14*v 23*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹*q⁻¹ ^ 2*z ^ 2 + 2*q ^ 14*v 23*(q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹ ^ 2*(q ^ 4 + q ^ 2 + 1)⁻¹*(q ^ 4 + 1)⁻¹